WEBVTT

00:02.020 --> 00:05.430
<i>I am infinitely replaceable.</i>

00:07.240 --> 00:09.990
<i>That's what I thought in my old world.</i>

00:13.220 --> 00:13.940
<i>But...</i>

00:14.640 --> 00:15.670
Yes. Probably.

00:14.640 --> 00:17.870
<i>there were people who needed me.</i>

00:15.670 --> 00:17.670
That worked well!

00:18.840 --> 00:20.090
<i>That made me so happy!</i>

00:20.510 --> 00:21.460
<i>In this world...</i>

00:21.460 --> 00:22.440
Like this!

00:22.010 --> 00:24.120
<i>everyone needs me.</i>

00:23.330 --> 00:24.840
It's "prisoner of flames, 
I release your binding chains"!

00:24.840 --> 00:25.780
Oh, that's right!

00:25.780 --> 00:26.420
I'm counting on you.

00:26.810 --> 00:28.340
It's your favorite food, right?!

00:27.050 --> 00:27.840
<i>That's why...</i>

00:28.350 --> 00:31.030
<i>I'm always looking for things I can do.</i>

00:31.030 --> 00:32.900
Morlock-san, keep going.

00:49.360 --> 00:50.870
This place is...

00:53.940 --> 00:55.260
Raelza?

01:00.160 --> 01:04.080
I'm so glad. I thought 
you might not wake up!

01:04.730 --> 01:05.940
Was I...

01:06.380 --> 01:09.180
As soon as we got back, 
you collapsed into a slumber.

01:09.180 --> 01:10.650
It's been more than one whole day.

01:10.650 --> 01:14.100
I'm sorry. All I do 
is cause trouble for you.

01:14.100 --> 01:16.100
You'd been frozen by magic.

01:17.700 --> 01:18.810
Saitou!

01:19.860 --> 01:21.300
It's no wonder.

01:21.920 --> 01:24.810
<i>Did she stay with me the whole time?</i>

01:27.560 --> 01:29.740
Right! What about Morlock-san?

01:36.140 --> 01:38.560
Saitou, the geezer is...

01:39.320 --> 01:42.000
Did you have a nice night?

01:42.000 --> 01:44.790
Stop that. Don't say things like 
that to the guests!

01:44.790 --> 01:47.260
The geezer's magical energy 
is inexhaustible.

01:47.260 --> 01:49.180
He gave everything he had to the dog,

01:49.180 --> 01:51.800
but the next morning 
he'd completely recovered.

01:53.500 --> 01:57.020
And since he's caused so much trouble 
for the proprietor here,

01:57.020 --> 01:59.180
he is now helping out around the inn.

01:59.180 --> 02:01.640
I didn't ask him to do that.

02:03.190 --> 02:05.790
Your room is this way.

02:05.790 --> 02:07.100
What? Wait!

02:08.940 --> 02:10.400
Hey, Grandpa!

02:10.410 --> 02:12.980
Give me my seven gold coins back!

02:17.700 --> 02:21.370
This is the first time I've climbed 
to the top of the great labyrinth.

02:21.600 --> 02:24.450
In preparation for when monsters 
come out of the labyrinth,

02:24.450 --> 02:26.580
the fortress is packed with soldiers.

02:27.720 --> 02:30.140
The crater made by the geezer's magic...

02:30.140 --> 02:31.880
It's visible from here, too.

02:32.480 --> 02:35.840
I'm glad that Morlock-san 
made a full recovery.

02:36.830 --> 02:38.750
So, Saitou...

02:39.290 --> 02:40.760
What did you want to talk about?

02:41.080 --> 02:44.630
I...don't remember changing my clothes.

02:45.510 --> 02:47.260
I didn't do that!

02:47.260 --> 02:49.530
The old dwarf guy...

02:50.010 --> 02:53.970
<i>Half a maderaka. 
Half a maderaka. Half a maderaka...</i>

02:52.180 --> 02:53.970
I'll switch with you.

02:54.410 --> 02:56.200
That's a relief.

02:57.300 --> 02:58.920
That's what you wanted to say?

02:58.920 --> 03:01.340
No, it's... the dog.

03:01.630 --> 03:02.910
The dog?

03:03.320 --> 03:08.000
It looked like you were talking
to the dog at several points.

03:08.000 --> 03:11.420
Is that because you once lived with a wolf?

03:12.340 --> 03:14.280
The geezer told you about that?

03:14.930 --> 03:15.800
Yes.

03:17.310 --> 03:19.600
We survived three winters together.

03:19.600 --> 03:21.890
The wolf looked a lot like that pup.

03:22.500 --> 03:25.380
I wonder if it's disappeared 
to somewhere, too.

03:28.670 --> 03:30.900
Maybe it's because I lived with a wolf,

03:30.900 --> 03:34.650
but I'm rougher and more crude 
than other women.

03:35.720 --> 03:41.060
Me, a useless, decrepit old magician, 
and a miserly fairy...

03:41.610 --> 03:45.400
This bizarre party is the only 
place someone like me can belong.

03:48.320 --> 03:50.760
I'm in that party too.

03:54.380 --> 03:57.280
I need you too, Raelza.

04:02.940 --> 04:05.280
More than anyone in this world.

04:05.280 --> 04:08.140
More than anyone in the world I came from.

04:21.580 --> 04:22.650
Saitou...

04:22.650 --> 04:23.620
Hey!

04:23.920 --> 04:26.010
Handyman!

04:26.620 --> 04:28.280
Gibungle-san?

04:28.880 --> 04:30.530
I've been looking for you.

04:30.820 --> 04:33.790
My master lost the keys to the inn 
and now he's in trouble!

04:33.790 --> 04:36.800
You're the only one 
who can pick the locks, right?

04:36.800 --> 04:37.940
Yes,

04:37.940 --> 04:40.560
because there are countermeasures 
against thieves set on them.

04:40.560 --> 04:42.620
He put on another guest's 
underpants by mistake

04:42.620 --> 04:44.680
and locked the door still wearing them!

04:44.680 --> 04:45.680
Hurry!

04:45.680 --> 04:47.140
R-Right!

05:14.440 --> 05:15.400
Sorry.

05:15.400 --> 05:19.180
It was me wearing your underpants after all!

05:19.180 --> 05:21.580
Why did you bring Saitou back with you?

05:21.580 --> 05:23.840
You are such a tactless dwarf!

05:23.880 --> 05:27.300
<b>What the 
Old Magician 
Is Keeping Secret</b>

05:30.260 --> 05:33.220
<b>Morlock had a secret</b>

05:33.800 --> 05:35.670
<i>So, my thingy?</i>

05:35.670 --> 05:39.240
<i>I regenerated it with magical energy
when I retrieved my power from the dog.</i>

05:40.380 --> 05:42.680
<i>But at the time, I couldn't 
control my magical energy,</i>

05:42.680 --> 05:45.360
<i>causing me to temporarily rejuvenate,
 and as a result...</i>

05:46.220 --> 05:49.570
<i>since I was still missing my thingy...</i>

05:50.000 --> 05:52.980
<i>it repeatedly regenerated and disappeared.</i>

05:52.980 --> 05:56.380
<i>I was without my thingy 
when my youth returned...</i>

05:57.240 --> 05:59.820
<i>and for just a moment, a miracle occurred.</i>

06:00.190 --> 06:03.340
<i>Huh? Did I become a woman?</i>

06:05.300 --> 06:06.640
<i>Saitou...</i>

06:07.030 --> 06:10.200
<i>Now that I look closely, 
he's got a cute face.</i>

06:11.150 --> 06:15.780
<i>If I'd been born a woman, 
I might have fallen in love with Saitou.</i>

06:18.740 --> 06:19.870
Morlock-san?

06:20.730 --> 06:22.470
I bought some honey.

06:22.470 --> 06:24.330
You said you wanted a taste, didn't you?

06:24.960 --> 06:27.650
He's so kind. I love him.

06:27.650 --> 06:29.070
Why?

06:29.110 --> 06:32.530
<b>The Handyman's 
Silversmithing</b>

06:32.830 --> 06:37.080
If you wrap the cord around your 
thumb like this and pull, the lock—

06:38.060 --> 06:40.290
the fastening will release 
and the blade pops out.

06:41.670 --> 06:43.580
It's still a little stiff.

06:44.200 --> 06:46.970
It's fine. It works, doesn't it?

06:47.240 --> 06:48.280
It's not good enough.

06:48.280 --> 06:51.740
In the heat of the moment, 
it needs to work smoothl—fluidly.

06:52.340 --> 06:53.440
He's so serious.

06:59.190 --> 07:00.220
Oh no!

07:02.020 --> 07:03.780
No, it's all right.

07:07.080 --> 07:09.040
It's done! Try it out!

07:11.700 --> 07:14.240
Yes, this is good.

07:17.230 --> 07:18.310
What's this?

07:19.130 --> 07:21.640
A hairpin. It's made of silver.

07:22.260 --> 07:24.150
What is it doing stuck here?

07:24.150 --> 07:26.360
Well, I wanted to surprise you.

07:26.360 --> 07:29.100
But, more importantly, does it work?

07:30.360 --> 07:32.180
Oh, for...

07:37.860 --> 07:39.720
Wh-What do you think?

07:42.910 --> 07:44.390
It looks nice on you!

07:44.500 --> 07:46.740
Well, well. Thanks for the treat!

07:45.020 --> 07:48.150
<b>Advised him to
give Raelza something
 that might look nice on her</b>

07:48.190 --> 07:51.610
<b>A Magical Beast, 
the Manticore</b>

07:58.380 --> 08:00.720
It looks just like Morlock-san!

08:01.040 --> 08:04.930
Scorching heat, gather now. Cage ablaze...

08:04.920 --> 08:07.360
fill now with spirit and will.

08:04.930 --> 08:06.080
<i>This is bad.</i>

08:06.080 --> 08:08.540
<i>Being confronted with something 
that looks just like me, her father,</i>

08:07.360 --> 08:10.550
Prisoner of flames, 
I release your binding—

08:08.540 --> 08:10.550
<i>Raelza won't be able to fight 
at her full strength!</i>

08:16.360 --> 08:19.000
This thing has an infuriating face!

08:17.110 --> 08:19.000
Increase Attack Power!

08:19.000 --> 08:21.940
They seem more motivated 
than usual, don't they?

08:21.940 --> 08:23.190
What do you think, Saitou?

08:23.190 --> 08:25.730
This is perfect! I can test out my crossbow!

08:25.730 --> 08:27.960
What do you mean, "This is perfect"?!

08:29.020 --> 08:32.440
<b>Do Sunlight 
Fairies Dream 
Human-Sized 
Dreams?</b>

08:33.640 --> 08:35.000
Raelza!

08:39.720 --> 08:41.380
Oh, right.

08:41.380 --> 08:44.980
She said she was taking Morlock-san 
for an acupuncture treatment.

08:42.280 --> 08:44.190
My back is a little...

08:44.190 --> 08:46.240
You are such a troublesome old geezer!

08:48.930 --> 08:50.520
What's this?

08:57.360 --> 08:59.290
You made a bath for me?

08:59.290 --> 09:02.890
I've been looking 
for a metal container this size.

09:04.220 --> 09:06.020
Then, I'll use it now!

09:09.820 --> 09:10.910
What's wrong?

09:10.910 --> 09:13.160
I-It's because you suddenly 
took your clothes off!

09:13.160 --> 09:14.810
That bothers you?

09:14.810 --> 09:16.610
We're a fairy and a human, you know?

09:16.830 --> 09:18.960
An elf would be different.

09:18.960 --> 09:21.580
I-Is that really how things work?

09:21.580 --> 09:24.130
So I step on this, right?

09:25.600 --> 09:28.500
Oh, this is bliss!

09:28.500 --> 09:30.800
I'm gonna wash my hair too!

09:30.800 --> 09:33.460
I didn't account for that! 
The bath will spill over!

09:33.460 --> 09:36.440
All right! Go and bring me some wine!

09:36.440 --> 09:39.470
Saitou, we're gonna have 
fun all night tonight!

09:39.720 --> 09:40.960
All right.

10:01.760 --> 10:02.990
What?

10:07.560 --> 10:10.000
What?!

10:13.200 --> 10:14.960
Thief's gear.

10:15.620 --> 10:17.420
Holy knight's armor.

10:17.730 --> 10:19.880
Magician's cloak!

10:19.880 --> 10:22.190
Being human-sized really is nice.

10:22.190 --> 10:23.940
There's so much to choose from!

10:23.940 --> 10:25.470
You're not going to buy anything?

10:25.470 --> 10:27.880
Raelza's casual clothes 
are good enough for me.

10:27.880 --> 10:30.400
You know I don't spend money.

10:30.400 --> 10:32.510
But your wings have even disappeared.

10:32.510 --> 10:34.790
I'll go back to normal if we just 
let things run their course, right?

10:34.790 --> 10:37.010
And this isn't bad in its own way.

10:39.920 --> 10:41.010
Lafa...

10:44.330 --> 10:46.320
What? For me?

10:46.990 --> 10:49.030
Yes. I thought it would suit you.

10:49.030 --> 10:52.330
I can't accept that! 
I can't compensate you for it.

10:52.340 --> 10:56.870
This might have happened 
because I used that weird vase.

10:56.870 --> 10:59.840
You used a bunch of your precious
gold coins to protect all of us.

10:59.840 --> 11:01.800
This is both an apology and a thank you!

11:02.350 --> 11:05.050
Well, if that's what it is, then...

11:12.570 --> 11:13.530
How is it?

11:15.270 --> 11:16.640
It looks nice on you!

11:19.150 --> 11:22.610
You should say that kind of thing to Raelza.

11:23.350 --> 11:26.080
I do say those things to Raelza!

11:29.820 --> 11:31.040
That's all right, then!

11:31.040 --> 11:32.820
Look ahead of you!

11:34.600 --> 11:36.390
That hurt.

11:36.390 --> 11:37.700
Oh, I'm sorry.

11:40.560 --> 11:44.120
You scratched my brand new leather armor.

11:44.120 --> 11:45.760
You gonna compensate me?

11:46.080 --> 11:49.930
Or you could come and have 
a good time with me instead.

11:50.440 --> 11:51.780
Wha—

11:52.270 --> 11:54.220
Stop that!

11:54.550 --> 11:57.700
Why would there be a scratch on the front 
if she bumped into you from behind?

11:58.220 --> 11:59.920
Those clothes...

11:59.920 --> 12:02.360
You're the one who found 
the new tunnel in the great labyrinth.

12:02.360 --> 12:04.360
Handyman Saitou, right?

12:05.070 --> 12:06.580
I've heard of you.

12:06.580 --> 12:10.530
They say your allies are strong, 
but you're a complete weakling.

12:10.530 --> 12:13.960
Stop trying to act like a big man 
just because you're a little famous!

12:19.390 --> 12:21.880
Ow, ow, ow! Let go!

12:21.880 --> 12:23.040
Ow, ow, ow!

12:23.040 --> 12:24.300
<i>Saitou...</i>

12:25.190 --> 12:28.800
<i>That's right. He's been getting stronger.</i>

12:29.690 --> 12:31.560
Blast you.

12:31.560 --> 12:32.680
Ow, ow...

12:34.270 --> 12:36.140
Lafa, are you all right?

12:46.630 --> 12:50.120
What was that? He was sort of amazing.

13:00.440 --> 13:01.380
Lafa?

13:06.890 --> 13:07.840
Lafa?

13:11.270 --> 13:13.060
I'm back to normal.

13:13.850 --> 13:15.990
Huh? What?!

13:22.070 --> 13:23.320
I'm sorry!

13:23.320 --> 13:26.550
But yesterday, you said it 
didn't matter if a human saw you!

13:27.450 --> 13:29.360
What are you doing, Saitou?

13:29.910 --> 13:31.920
What took you so long, Raelza?

13:31.920 --> 13:32.840
I told you.

13:32.840 --> 13:35.460
The acupuncturist's house is far away.

13:35.460 --> 13:38.830
But the geezer seems to be doing well now.

13:38.830 --> 13:40.880
He's already drinking downstairs.

13:41.540 --> 13:43.050
Did something happen here?

13:43.050 --> 13:45.840
It's been crazy.

13:45.840 --> 13:48.840
Raelza! Give me my seven gold coins back!

13:49.180 --> 13:53.590
We settled the matter by increasing 
your share, you greedy fairy.

13:53.590 --> 13:54.590
Hmph!

13:54.590 --> 13:58.130
If you don't take care of it, 
I'll take the prince instead!

13:58.130 --> 13:59.010
Wha—

13:59.410 --> 14:00.640
<i>Just kidding!</i>

14:00.640 --> 14:03.900
<i>It's a good thing I'm from 
a different people, isn't it?</i>

14:05.800 --> 14:07.400
That happened to Lafanpan?

14:07.400 --> 14:09.880
Was it this that caused it?

14:09.880 --> 14:13.190
I can't think of any other reason for it.

14:13.190 --> 14:14.470
Where is Morlock-san?

14:14.470 --> 14:15.880
Out having fun.

14:16.160 --> 14:19.270
The geezer is like irresponsibility 
dressed up and walking around.

14:19.690 --> 14:21.840
You seem to be troubled.

14:22.300 --> 14:25.100
I've seen this exact same scene before.

14:25.100 --> 14:28.130
I, Gibungle, shall give you my aid!

14:28.130 --> 14:30.550
According to the Magipedia...

14:30.550 --> 14:33.430
That vase temporarily 
makes entities like fairies

14:33.430 --> 14:35.530
and small monsters temporarily larger.

14:35.530 --> 14:38.520
The object is imbued with powerful 
magical energy. That's what it says.

14:38.520 --> 14:39.350
Wow!

14:39.350 --> 14:42.520
The geezer does hoard 
a lot of strange things.

14:42.520 --> 14:44.270
Raelza!

14:44.800 --> 14:48.730
I lost at cards, so they 
took everything I had.

14:48.730 --> 14:50.850
Hide that dirty thing, you geezer!

14:50.850 --> 14:52.680
Grandpa, you're so dirty!

14:52.680 --> 14:53.860
Master...

14:53.860 --> 14:55.990
Shall I bring some of my clothes for you?

14:56.270 --> 14:59.670
Dirty? There's no need 
to say that, is there?

14:59.670 --> 15:01.670
Oh! That's perfect!

15:01.670 --> 15:04.080
If I hide it with this, 
you can't complain, right?

15:04.080 --> 15:04.980
There.

15:10.800 --> 15:12.510
Morlock-san's thing! It's...

15:12.510 --> 15:14.390
Saitou, dodge!

15:15.090 --> 15:17.800
What have you done, you old geezer?!

15:15.740 --> 15:17.800
Grow big and strong!

15:17.850 --> 15:21.270
<b>The Handyman 
Is Very Busy</b>

15:23.750 --> 15:26.520
Money on hand is getting tight.

15:30.480 --> 15:32.370
Oh, what a mess.

15:32.780 --> 15:34.420
What should I do?

15:35.760 --> 15:37.170
May I see that for a moment?

15:41.170 --> 15:43.730
Thank you. You're quite skilled.

15:43.730 --> 15:45.280
Well, it wasn't much.

15:45.280 --> 15:48.260
Those clothes... Are you Handyman Saitou?

15:48.800 --> 15:50.130
How did you know that?

15:50.460 --> 15:52.480
These days, you're famous.

15:52.480 --> 15:55.290
I've heard you're a remarkable 
artisan who can do anything!

15:55.290 --> 15:56.390
Oh, no. I'm not...

15:56.720 --> 15:58.840
What? Did she say Handyman Saitou?

15:58.840 --> 16:00.830
Can you fix my bag?

16:00.830 --> 16:02.350
I've got a hole in my shoe.

16:02.350 --> 16:04.430
There's something off about 
the way my windows are set.

16:04.430 --> 16:06.600
Can you really cook hydras?

16:06.880 --> 16:10.600
W-Wait just a moment. One at a time...

16:13.610 --> 16:17.540
You were working until this late at night?

16:17.840 --> 16:20.520
Lots of people asked me to do odd jobs.

16:20.520 --> 16:23.850
But thanks to that, I received 
enough to pay for food.

16:25.440 --> 16:28.000
You probably could have 
let them give you more.

16:28.450 --> 16:33.290
When it comes to leatherwork 
and carpentry, I'm not a pro—an expert.

16:33.290 --> 16:36.520
I just don't feel right accepting what 
a real artisan would charge.

16:36.520 --> 16:40.010
Still, you should make sure 
that they compensate you for your labor.

16:40.360 --> 16:42.040
That's true.

16:42.040 --> 16:44.380
When I'm a little more 
familiar with this world,

16:44.380 --> 16:47.510
maybe I could be a handyman here too.

16:47.510 --> 16:48.670
Sounds good!

16:48.670 --> 16:52.030
You could have a little shop like Maevena's.

16:52.030 --> 16:54.550
A-And if you do that, I'll help you!

16:54.550 --> 16:58.320
I'm not good with numbers, 
but I can arrange products and...

16:58.320 --> 17:00.660
Saitou! We've been looking for you!

17:00.660 --> 17:01.770
You two are...

17:01.770 --> 17:04.140
It's the lovely elf and my dear Ninia!

17:04.140 --> 17:05.970
My demi-gauntlet broke.

17:05.970 --> 17:07.360
Will you fix it for me?

17:07.360 --> 17:10.370
In truth, I'd like to repair it for her,

17:10.370 --> 17:12.800
but I'm not good at that sort of thing.

17:13.040 --> 17:14.320
I am here as well!

17:14.320 --> 17:15.760
Who is he again?

17:16.320 --> 17:17.820
Hey there, Handyman Saitou!

17:17.820 --> 17:19.640
Will you fix my clothes for me?

17:19.640 --> 17:21.720
The dragon scales came off.

17:22.170 --> 17:24.040
Magical Beast Hunter Liliza?

17:24.360 --> 17:26.170
And Guivre-san.

17:26.700 --> 17:29.190
I-It has been a while.

17:30.000 --> 17:31.160
Master Saitou...

17:31.160 --> 17:34.660
I'd like you to teach me how to make 
that bread you ate before.

17:34.660 --> 17:37.830
Monpui says he really wants to eat some!

17:37.830 --> 17:41.410
I'm tired. Let's go back to the inn.

17:41.410 --> 17:43.950
It's the kingdom's officially 
recognized Hero's party.

17:44.460 --> 17:48.520
Mister Saitou, do you think 
you could appraise this for me?

17:48.520 --> 17:51.040
Maevena! How have you been?

17:51.920 --> 17:53.030
Excuse me.

17:53.030 --> 17:54.760
Our king—

17:54.760 --> 17:58.790
A magical knight of our acquaintance 
has broken an important treasure.

17:58.790 --> 18:01.930
I thought that a craftsman of your 
reputation might be able to repair it.

18:01.930 --> 18:04.370
I accidentally dropped it and it chipped.

18:04.370 --> 18:06.640
That's why we keep telling you 
to wear it properly.

18:07.400 --> 18:09.640
The magician from some other 
kingdom and friends, too?

18:09.640 --> 18:10.730
Saitou!

18:10.730 --> 18:12.610
I have perfected the greatest of locks!

18:12.610 --> 18:14.640
If you think you can open it, 
then go ahead and try!

18:15.290 --> 18:17.150
Even Dohnbain-san is here?

18:17.150 --> 18:18.760
Hurry up and fix it, won't you?

18:18.760 --> 18:20.560
We've been looking everywhere for you!

18:20.560 --> 18:21.660
I am here as well.

18:21.660 --> 18:22.550
Who is he again?

18:22.550 --> 18:24.800
Would you go... exploring or
 something with me sometime?

18:24.800 --> 18:25.550
The bread.

18:25.550 --> 18:29.170
Cainz! Come on, let's go back!

18:27.990 --> 18:29.170
Now, now...

18:29.170 --> 18:31.740
Do you think you could 
fix it quickly for us?

18:31.740 --> 18:33.520
We've prepared compensation 
if you're wondering.

18:33.520 --> 18:35.170
Saitou! Try opening it!

18:35.170 --> 18:39.050
Come on! Saitou! Can't we just...

18:36.900 --> 18:39.050
If you all ask so suddenly, I...

18:39.050 --> 18:42.490
If you would just... Oh, come on! Saitou!

18:39.430 --> 18:42.490
Hey, can't you see Saitou's overwhelmed?

18:42.490 --> 18:44.190
Come back tomorrow or something!

18:44.440 --> 18:46.950
Why is Miss Raelza taking charge?

18:46.950 --> 18:49.150
She's already acting like the wife, huh?

18:49.470 --> 18:51.740
If it's not your business, stay out of it.

18:52.300 --> 18:54.580
I am a member of the same party!

18:54.580 --> 18:57.650
And you can just wrap some wire 
around that thing to fix it yourself!

18:57.650 --> 18:58.860
What did you just say?

18:58.860 --> 19:01.150
Do you want to have a rematch right here?

19:01.150 --> 19:03.370
I'd like nothing better!

19:03.360 --> 19:04.640
If you'd please fix this quickly.

19:03.370 --> 19:07.320
Mister Saitou, couldn't you just hurry 
up and appraise this for me?

19:04.640 --> 19:06.040
I was here first!

19:06.730 --> 19:07.330
Um...

19:07.640 --> 19:08.620
Here!

19:08.620 --> 19:09.790
If you would.

19:09.790 --> 19:11.340
Numbered tickets!

19:11.340 --> 19:13.240
They're one gold coin each!

19:13.470 --> 19:16.250
Now, now. Why don't we start
 with a little drink?

19:16.250 --> 19:17.760
You geezer, don't touch me!

19:18.160 --> 19:20.140
I am here as well!

19:18.570 --> 19:20.140
Who is he again?

19:20.630 --> 19:23.120
Everyone, calm down.

19:25.840 --> 19:28.400
All right, get your numbered tickets here!

19:26.440 --> 19:29.210
I'll tell you where you can buy 
some delicious dried sweet potato.

19:27.760 --> 19:29.850
No, we really can't.

19:30.370 --> 19:31.680
No pushing now!

19:30.740 --> 19:33.100
You're happy seeing him again 
after so long, aren't you?

19:33.100 --> 19:33.850
Yes, I-I suppose I am.

19:33.850 --> 19:36.280
There's enough for everyone!

19:36.280 --> 19:37.360
I'll have something to eat too!

19:37.360 --> 19:39.520
The materials it's made of are quite superb.

19:39.520 --> 19:41.360
Oh, this is pretty good!

19:39.530 --> 19:41.360
Oh, you can tell?

19:41.740 --> 19:44.010
My dear Ninia...

19:41.750 --> 19:44.010
Hey, geezer. Stop that already.

19:44.010 --> 19:45.820
Just punch him already.

19:44.010 --> 19:48.360
Ninia, you are so very lovely.

20:00.320 --> 20:03.400
<i>I feel fulfilled...</i>

20:04.030 --> 20:07.300
<i>far more than I ever did in my old world.</i>

20:08.310 --> 20:13.430
<i>That world I had always envisioned</i>

20:13.430 --> 20:16.480
<i>Could I have found it?</i>

20:25.950 --> 20:30.570
<i>I lived my days at someone 
else's convenience</i>

20:30.990 --> 20:35.200
<i>Gaining nothing but compromises and regrets</i>

20:35.200 --> 20:37.090
<i>Because I always felt that</i>

20:37.340 --> 20:41.010
<i>Even if it wasn't me standing here</i>

20:41.230 --> 20:45.270
<i>The world would still keep moving forward</i>

20:45.270 --> 20:49.070
<i>Even after I lost it</i>

20:49.070 --> 20:51.010
<i>And its colors faded</i>

20:51.350 --> 20:55.440
<i>The dream from that hazily remembered day</i>

20:55.430 --> 20:57.390
<i>Still remained</i>

20:57.390 --> 20:59.820
<i>The thing that only I can do</i>

20:59.820 --> 21:02.320
<i>And the scenery that I left behind</i>

21:02.540 --> 21:09.960
<i>I was just looking for an answer 
from some other time</i>

21:11.320 --> 21:16.040
<i>Those things that don't change</i>

21:16.250 --> 21:21.830
<i>And those words I protected so carefully</i>

21:21.830 --> 21:26.470
<i>Even if they're all just 
unattractive junk to others</i>

21:26.470 --> 21:32.710
<i>They're all treasures 
that I will never give up</i>

21:41.510 --> 21:46.360
<i>Unable to become someone special</i>

21:46.360 --> 21:50.820
<i>I'd cover it up with a forced smile</i>

21:50.820 --> 21:52.940
<i>Before I knew it</i>

21:52.940 --> 21:57.000
<i>I'd convinced myself 
that that’s how life works</i>

21:57.000 --> 22:01.850
<i>I got used to running away</i>

22:12.280 --> 22:15.070
<i>Though I knew I'd never reach it</i>

22:15.070 --> 22:18.310
<i>My pathetic inability 
to let it go and move on</i>

22:18.520 --> 22:22.150
<i>Made me hang my head</i>

22:22.500 --> 22:28.260
<i>Even when I couldn't see 
that I was stuck in place</i>

22:28.260 --> 22:32.720
<i>There were surely many other 
things that never paid off</i>

22:32.720 --> 22:40.010
<i>But I want to believe that 
each of them will be an answer</i>

22:40.010 --> 22:46.090
<i>I just know it</i>

22:47.180 --> 22:52.000
<i>Those things that don't change</i>

22:52.000 --> 22:57.680
<i>And those aspirations 
I protected so carefully</i>

22:57.680 --> 23:02.300
<i>Even if they're all just 
unattractive junk to others</i>

23:02.300 --> 23:10.490
<i>They all make me who I am, 
and I'll never give them up</i>
